cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the M3-CRETE firmware configuration in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "M3-CRETE Firmware: Configuration and Setup for the M3-CRETE Concrete 3D Printer"
abstract: >-
  Firmware configuration files and optional patches for operating the
  M3-CRETE open-hardware concrete 3D printer. Provides Marlin and Klipper
  configurations plus install tooling; upstream firmware source is obtained
  from its original projects and is not redistributed here.
type: software
authors:
